From b89ba9dd018e3a33240e5214ad8143b40f277bfb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabe Ebmeyer <sasukegabe777@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:13:12 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Fix session audio, lineup retries, inventory reset, and
 earned loot

Preserve menu editing after rejected departures, validate belts, settle deferred loot before results, clear old displays on reset, and provide bundled music fallbacks. Correct autoplay purchases and join UPnP workers at shutdown. Includes focused regression probes. Handoff for merging into the newer Sonic project; not a final release.
